ts in the Discord Channel HERE Screenshots must be your own work and taken in Roads & Riches using Photo Mode. Prizes: 3 winners will each receive a $10 Steam Gift Card!October 19–26, 2026Show us your best caravan setups, share your favorite m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:02:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3987430-1846651706691493","game_id":"steam-3987430","kind":"announcement","title":"Roads & Riches Joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Merchants! It's that time again!Steam Next Fest is here, running October 19th to October 26th, and we're inviting you to join us on the road!If you've been meaning to try Roads & Riches, now's the perfect time to hop aboard our caravan and see what being a traveling merchant is all about. Our Demo has improved a lot since its early days, with new quests, equipment, events, customer professions, visual upgrades, and more!Check out our latest trailer!Haven't played in a while? There's never been a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:01:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3987430-1846018067934951","game_id":"steam-3987430","kind":"update","title":"A World of Wares! Demo Update Arrives","summary":"A Golden day to you, Merchants! That squawking and flutter of feathers you hear? That's a sign of our new Demo Update!Arriving via crow today, we have: Additional Quests, New Equipment, Updated Events, Visual World Improvements, and more! Let's unbox today's delivery, below.As always, if you're enjoying the Roads & Riches Demo so far, please consider dropping us a review - it helps us a great deal! EquipmentWe've added 22 new pieces of Equipment to the Demo, bringing us to a total of 60 pieces (","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T23:49:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934951","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3987430-1844751498232286","game_id":"steam-3987430","kind":"update","title":"Burgeoning new highs! Check out our latest Demo Patch!","summary":"Merchants! It's that time again! We've deployed a new update to the Roads & Riches Demo, with a wide inventory of changes. We'd like to extend a big thanks to our community for submitting bug reports and feedback; we're building Roads & Riches with you! But first, we have an important community announcement:Our Community Is Moving!You may know by now that successful merchants are always on the move - so now it's time for a move of our own!We’re migrating to the Alvios Games Discord server, where","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T18:36:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232286","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3987430-1842212951301593","game_id":"steam-3987430","kind":"update","title":"Fresh Demo Update!","summary":"Good day, Merchants!Today's Roads & Riches Demo update brings a caravan-load of changes, new features, and extra ways to customize your workflow! Here's what you can expect from today's update: Clipboard + Radial Wheel, Automaton Upkeep + Gathering, Improved Character Customization, Lookout Points, and a few other improvements!Take a stroll through the Steam page to check out the Demo if you haven't given it a spin yet! If you've been enjoying your time in the Golden Reaches, please consider lea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T23:55:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951301593","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3987430-1839676055886557","game_id":"steam-3987430","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Delivery!","summary":"Welcome back, Merchants - come check out our wares updates!Today's Roads & Riches Demo delivery includes a HUGE amount of changes, some new features, and fresh ways to style your rolling merchant home! Tidy up your shop and get ready for Photo Mode, the Herb Bag, Caravan Customization + Fanfare, and much more!If you haven't tried the Demo yet, stop on by the the Steam page to play today! If you have tried it and are enjoying your time, please consider leaving a review on the demo page - it helps","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T22:34:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886557","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3987430-1838407329257438","game_id":"steam-3987430","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Roads & Riches Demo Today!","summary":"The road calls to you, Merchants; the Roads & Riches Demo is available now!Grab your friends, some funds, and a frugal business sense then head over to the Steam page to play today! In this glimpse of Roads & Riches: Traveling Merchant Simulator; you'll venture across one of our major regions, build up your caravan, and inspire loyal customers with incredible treasures!Adding Roads & Riches to your Wishlist is a great way to stay up to date with more info and it's honestly a huge help to the gam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T17:33:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329257438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3987430-1837955055364524","game_id":"steam-3987430","kind":"announcement","title":"Roads & Riches Demo - Arriving July 16th!","summary":"Calling all budding Merchants!Mark you calendars and your maps - the Roads & Riches Demo arrives July 16th!There's a wealth of wonder to explore in the free demo! Grab your friends and head on over to the Steam page to play when the time comes! It's also worth mentioning that adding Roads & Riches to your Wishlist helps us a great deal! Getting Down To Business!Get your free sample of our Traveling Merchant Simulator; venture across one of our major regions, build up your caravan, and inspire lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T21:49:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364524","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3987430-1836506165569150","game_id":"steam-3987430","kind":"announcement","title":"The First Roads & Riches Playtest!","summary":"Hello Merchants!Time for your first steps on the Roads & Riches journey! Today, we're launching our first public playtest! This is a small preview of the main game, built to help us gather feedback and fix bugs - while also giving you a sense of what to expect from the full game!Please note: as this is an early preview build of the game, things are likely to change during development. Saved games may behave strangely over time as we iterate!What's In The Playtest?The Roads & Riches Playtest lets","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T22:14:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steam